abstract: >-
  Archival codebase of the Motion Pixels master's thesis (MaAI, IAAC, 2025-2026):
  pedestrian tracking, plan calibration, behavioral mapping, Encoder V3 spatial encoding and
  LSTM trajectory prediction (final model MODEL_XC_B_CURV_LIGHT) for architectural analysis.
